<title>UK: Jardine Lloyd unit buys U.S. firm.</title>
<headline>Jardine Lloyd unit buys U.S. firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance broker Jardine Lloyd Thompson Group Plc said on Friday a U.S. unit agreed to buy Administrative Consultants Inc in Connecticut for an initial payment of $8.0 million.</p>
<p>An additional of up to $4.75 million was deferred and linked to performance targest, Jardine Lloyd said in a statement. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
